# PC card pc-team-clear (BENCH-170): arm bb against aa, 45 teams (TidalWave out) x 12 seeds from 7600. Template: clprep writes work/team-clear-bb.args with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml
--team
true
--seeds
12
--seed-base
7600
--rounds
10
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-angles-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@bb.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@bb
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-clear-@V@-bb
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-clear-bb.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
